Additionally, our strategic alliance with the European Space Agency (ESA) for the development of dual-use technologies promises to expand our market reach in Europe. This collaboration focuses on developing advanced satellite systems capable of both commercial and military applications, ensuring compliance with international regulations.

As we look ahead, AstraTech is committed to enhancing our capabilities through innovative engineering solutions and by leveraging the expertise of industry leaders. Our upcoming projects, including the Horizon-1 communications satellite, are set to revolutionize satellite communications, providing enhanced bandwidth and reduced latency for users worldwide. Continuous investments in technology and strategic partnerships remain at the forefront of our mission to redefine the future of space systems.